+ * pptxgenjs calls: shape(), freeform() and tx().  The source file ships with no
+ * media parts at all - its picture placeholders are empty frames that render as
+ * nothing - so there is no raster artwork to stand in for here.
+ *
+ *   node <thisfile>.js   ->   writes <thisfile>.pptx next to the script
+ */
